    },
    {
      "id": "page3",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "If I may say so, and I will, I feed Poffins to my Pokémon! And why, I say, would I do that?"
      ],
      "input": {
        "type": "option",
        "vertical": false,
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "Next",
            "value": "next",
